          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ढगाळ (ḍhagāḷ) is ḍhag, \"cloud\", with the ending -āḷ, \"full of\". The origin of ḍhag is not settled: neither CDIAL nor DEDR has an entry for it."
